  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密。鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。小李最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你做了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思。领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯。小李，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您来这么晚，只能吃剩菜了吧。领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。说的好，怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。小李啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路，走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？哈哈，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。哈哈哈哈，小李呀，我看你最近是越来越精神了啊，那是因为沾了领导，您的光跟着您干事儿，气色都不敢差。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，小李啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本把话说的恰到好处，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，真是让我欲解心开啊，每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 640,
      "end_ms": 1940,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2380,
      "end_ms": 3200,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3620,
      "end_ms": 3980,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3980,
      "end_ms": 4940,
      "text": "才守得住秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7320,
      "end_ms": 8240,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8620,
      "end_ms": 9740,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9880,
      "end_ms": 10140,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10140,
      "end_ms": 11760,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 11840,
      "end_ms": 14700,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17400,
      "end_ms": 18940,
      "text": "小李最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19180,
      "end_ms": 21280,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你做了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21600,
      "end_ms": 22860,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23080,
      "end_ms": 23780,
      "text": "听这意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 24080,
      "end_ms": 25280,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 25440,
      "end_ms": 26740,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 29200,
      "end_ms": 29660,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30020,
      "end_ms": 31770,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32270,
      "end_ms": 33990,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33990,
      "end_ms": 36530,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36530,
      "end_ms": 40270,
      "text": "我先敬您来这么晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40690,
      "end_ms": 41990,
      "text": "只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42550,
      "end_ms": 44370,
      "text": "领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 44670,
      "end_ms": 46690,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 46870,
      "end_ms": 48250,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 48490,
      "end_ms": 49130,
      "text": "说的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50250,
      "end_ms": 51350,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 51630,
      "end_ms": 52970,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53930,
      "end_ms": 54930,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54990,
      "end_ms": 56430,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56610,
      "end_ms": 59335,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 60480,
      "end_ms": 61125,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 61510,
      "end_ms": 62950,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 62950,
      "end_ms": 64005,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64280,
      "end_ms": 65820,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 66000,
      "end_ms": 67695,
      "text": "走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 68960,
      "end_ms": 69470,
      "text": "哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 70440,
      "end_ms": 71875,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 72240,
      "end_ms": 73535,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 73990,
      "end_ms": 75055,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 75360,
      "end_ms": 76685,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77130,
      "end_ms": 77960,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 78470,
      "end_ms": 79255,
      "text": "小李呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 79740,
      "end_ms": 81895,
      "text": "我看你最近是越来越精神了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 82450,
      "end_ms": 83410,
      "text": "那是因为沾了领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 83410,
      "end_ms": 85110,
      "text": "您的光跟着您干事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 85110,
      "end_ms": 86194,
      "text": "气色都不敢差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 86690,
      "end_ms": 88205,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 88390,
      "end_ms": 89055,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 89390,
      "end_ms": 90910,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 90970,
      "end_ms": 92025,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 92340,
      "end_ms": 94745,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 95090,
      "end_ms": 96670,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 96770,
      "end_ms": 98335,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 98540,
      "end_ms": 99600,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 99660,
      "end_ms": 100320,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 100440,
      "end_ms": 101440,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 101660,
      "end_ms": 103880,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 104100,
      "end_ms": 106015,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 106300,
      "end_ms": 107120,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 107180,
      "end_ms": 108420,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 108480,
      "end_ms": 111175,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 111530,
      "end_ms": 112750,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 112750,
      "end_ms": 113715,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 113980,
      "end_ms": 114120,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 114120,
      "end_ms": 116435,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 116720,
      "end_ms": 117300,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 117520,
      "end_ms": 118600,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118820,
      "end_ms": 120205,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 120550,
      "end_ms": 122005,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 122240,
      "end_ms": 123995,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 124250,
      "end_ms": 125170,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 125190,
      "end_ms": 128225,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 128470,
      "end_ms": 129510,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 129530,
      "end_ms": 130755,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 131240,
      "end_ms": 132655,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 132970,
      "end_ms": 134375,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 134760,
      "end_ms": 136140,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 136220,
      "end_ms": 137925,
      "text": "真是让我欲解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 138670,
      "end_ms": 140155,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 140640,
      "end_ms": 144300,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 144580,
      "end_ms": 147535,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 147770,
      "end_ms": 149195,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 149580,
      "end_ms": 151075,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 151330,
      "end_ms": 153370,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 153670,
      "end_ms": 154995,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 155320,
      "end_ms": 157985,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff22473748c22b5f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 158310,
      "end_ms": 160415,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
